SUMMARY:Review: 2022–2025 EV Unit Price Comparison
DESCRIPTION:Collaborative review of extracted 2022 euro unit price points from ten expert call summaries and matched 2025 prices from the latest expert synthesis. Validate family mapping for “Vehicle electronics sensors and controls” and “EV charging and onboard power\,” source traceability\, annual average calculations\, and percent-change methodology before the results are reported. No analytical findings are assumed in this meeting.
LOCATION:EV Pricing Review project workspace
